Third-party material in this repository
=======================================

This crate is an independent implementation. It links to nothing and copies
no code. What it does contain is data, and several tables are generated from
upstream sources rather than invented here -- the language list has to be
byte-for-byte the one fontconfig serializes, or every langset in a cache
decodes wrongly.

Those sources are vendored under tools/data/ so the generators in tools/ can
be run and their output verified. Each is listed below with its terms.


