Not vendored
------------

tools/gen_name_langs.py also reads FreeType's ttnameid.h, for the numeric
values of the TT_MS_LANGID_* and TT_MAC_LANGID_* constants that
fcfreetype.c's mapping table is written in terms of. That header is licensed
under the FreeType License or GPLv2, and is left as a build-time prerequisite
rather than redistributed here: install FreeType's development headers to run
that one generator. Its output, src/name_langs.rs, is committed like the
others, so building this crate never needs it.
